<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= typeof title !== 'undefined' ? title : 'Project Report - Vehicle Accident Detection Alert System' %></title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0d1117;
            --bg-gradient: radial-gradient(circle at top right, #1a2332 0%, #0d1117 100%);
            --surface-color: rgba(22, 27, 34, 0.7);
            --surface-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            --text-primary: #ffffff;
            --text-secondary: #8b949e;
            --accent-blue: #2f81f7;
            --accent-cyan: #39d353;
            --accent-purple: #a371f7;
            --status-critical: #f85149;
            --status-warning: #d29922;
            --status-good: #238636;
            --font-main: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            --glass-bg: rgba(22, 27, 34, 0.4);
            --glass-blur: blur(16px);
            --radius-sm: 8px;
            --radius-md: 12px;
            --radius-lg: 20px;
            --shadow-main: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            --shadow-glow: 0 0 20px rgba(47, 129, 247, 0.4);
            --shadow-glow-critical: 0 0 25px rgba(248, 81, 73, 0.6);
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: var(--font-main);
            background: var(--bg-color);
            background-image: var(--bg-gradient);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        .glass-panel {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
            border: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-main);
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        .app-container { display: flex; width: 100%; height: 100vh; }
        .sidebar {
            width: 280px;
            background: rgba(13, 17, 23, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            z-index: 1000;
        }
        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .brand i { color: var(--status-critical); font-size: 1.8rem; }
        .nav-menu {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }
        .nav-link {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-weight: 500;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .nav-link:hover, .nav-item.active .nav-link {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            background: rgba(47, 129, 247, 0.1);
            box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--accent-blue);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .main-content {
            flex-grow: 1;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        .page-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fff, #8b949e);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .nav-item-spaced { margin-top: 2rem; }
        .nav-item-bottom { margin-top: auto; }
        .page-subtitle { color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 5px; }
        .user-widget-text { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500; }
        .about-container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .about-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
        .about-title { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--accent-blue); }
        .about-subtitle { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); }
        .about-section { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
        .section-title { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--surface-border); padding-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .section-text { line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-secondary); }
        .grid-cards-2col { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
        .arch-card { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); }
        .arch-card-title-blue { color: var(--accent-blue); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .arch-card-title-purple { color: var(--accent-purple); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .arch-card-title-cyan { color: var(--accent-cyan); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .arch-card-title-red { color: var(--status-critical); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .arch-card-text { color: var(--text-secondary); }
        .about-list { list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8; }
        .grid-cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }
        .user-widget {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            background: var(--surface-color);
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            border: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
        }
        .user-avatar {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent-blue);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #fff;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .sidebar { transform: translateX(-100%); position: absolute; height: 100%; }
            .main-content { padding: 1.5rem; }
            .grid-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .grid-cards-2col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="app-container">

        <!-- Sidebar -->
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <div class="brand">
                <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="color: var(--status-critical); font-size: 1.8rem; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px var(--status-critical));">
                    <path d="M18.92 6.01C18.72 5.42 18.16 5 17.5 5h-11c-.66 0-1.21.42-1.42 1.01L3 12v8c0 .55.45 1 1 1h1c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-1h12v1c0 .55.45 1 1 1h1c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-8l-2.08-5.99zM6.5 16c-.83 0-1.5-.67-1.5-1.5S5.67 13 6.5 13s1.5.67 1.5 1.5S7.33 16 6.5 16zm11 0c-.83 0-1.5-.67-1.5-1.5s.67-1.5 1.5-1.5 1.5.67 1.5 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5 1.5zM5 11l1.5-4.5h11L19 11H5z"/>
                </svg>
                <span>SAFE WAY</span>
            </div>

            <ul class="nav-menu">
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a href="/index" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M10 20v-6h4v6h5v-8h3L12 3 2 12h3v8z"/></svg> Home</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a href="/live" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M16 6l2.29 2.29-4.88 4.88-4-4L2 16.59 3.41 18l6-6 4 4 6.3-6.29L22 12V6z"/></svg> Live Sensors</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a href="/location" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zm0 9.5c-1.38 0-2.5-1.12-2.5-2.5s1.12-2.5 2.5-2.5 2.5 1.12 2.5 2.5-1.12 2.5-2.5 2.5z"/></svg> GPS Map</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item critical">
                    <a href="/alert" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M1 21h22L12 2 1 21zm12-3h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2v-4h2v4z"/></svg> Emergency Alerts</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item active nav-item-spaced">
                    <a href="/about" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M21 5c-1.11-.35-2.33-.5-3.5-.5-1.95 0-4.05.4-5.5 1.5-1.45-1.1-3.55-1.5-5.5-1.5S2.45 4.9 1 6v14.65c0 .25.25.5.5.5.1 0 .15-.05.25-.05C3.1 20.45 5.05 20 6.5 20c1.95 0 4.05.4 5.5 1.5 1.35-.85 3.8-1.5 5.5-1.5 1.65 0 3.35.3 4.75 1.05.1.05.15.05.25.05.25 0 .5-.25.5-.5V6c-.6-.45-1.25-.75-2-1zm0 13.5c-1.1-.35-2.3-.5-3.5-.5-1.7 0-4.15.65-5.5 1.5V8c1.35-.85 3.8-1.5 5.5-1.5 1.2 0 2.4.15 3.5.5v11.5z"/></svg> Project Report</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a href="/contact" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M20 4H4c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L2 18c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 4l-8 5-8-5V6l8 5 8-5v2z"/></svg> Contacts / Admin</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item nav-item-bottom">
                    <a href="/login" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M17 7l-1.41 1.41L18.17 11H8v2h10.17l-2.58 2.58L17 17l5-5zM4 5h8V3H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h8v-2H4V5z"/></svg> Logout</a>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </aside>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <main class="main-content">

            <header class="top-header">
                <div>
                    <h1 class="page-title">Project Report</h1>
                    <p class="page-subtitle">Vehicle Accident Detection Alert System</p>
                </div>
                <div class="user-widget">
                    <span class="user-widget-text"><%= typeof user !== 'undefined' && user ? user.username : 'Admin' %></span>
                    <div class="user-avatar"><%= typeof user !== 'undefined' && user ? user.username.charAt(0).toUpperCase() : 'A' %></div>
                </div>
            </header>

            <div class="about-container">

                <!-- Project Overview -->
                <section class="about-section">
                    <div class="about-header">
                        <h2 class="about-title">Vehicle Accident Detection Alert System</h2>
                        <p class="about-subtitle">Advanced IoT-based Emergency Response System</p>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- System Architecture -->
                <section class="about-section">
                    <h3 class="section-title">System Architecture</h3>
                    <div class="grid-cards grid-cards-2col">
                        <div class="arch-card">
                            <h4 class="arch-card-title-blue">Hardware Layer</h4>
                            <p class="arch-card-text">ESP32 microcontroller with MPU-6500 accelerometer, GPS/GSM module for real-time data collection and communication.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="arch-card">
                            <h4 class="arch-card-title-purple">Processing Layer</h4>
                            <p class="arch-card-text">Real-time G-force analysis and collision detection algorithms with automatic alert triggering.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="arch-card">
                            <h4 class="arch-card-title-cyan">Communication Layer</h4>
                            <p class="arch-card-text">SMS gateway integration for emergency contact notification and web dashboard synchronization.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="arch-card">
                            <h4 class="arch-card-title-red">Alert Layer</h4>
                            <p class="arch-card-text">Multi-channel emergency response system with location sharing and status tracking.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- Technical Specifications -->
                <section class="about-section">
                    <h3 class="section-title">Technical Specifications</h3>
                    <div class="glass-panel">
                        <h4 style="color: var(--accent-blue); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Hardware Components</h4>
                        <ul class="about-list">
                            <li><strong>ESP32 Microcontroller:</strong> Dual-core processor with WiFi and Bluetooth connectivity</li>
                            <li><strong>MPU-6500 Sensor:</strong> 6-axis MEMS motion tracking device (3-axis accelerometer + 3-axis gyroscope)</li>
                            <li><strong>GPS Module:</strong> Real-time location tracking with latitude/longitude extraction</li>
                            <li><strong>GSM Module:</strong> SMS transmission capability for emergency alerts</li>
                            <li><strong>Power Management:</strong> Battery backup and power monitoring system</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- Detection Algorithm -->
                <section class="about-section">
                    <h3 class="section-title">Collision Detection Algorithm</h3>
                    <div class="glass-panel">
                        <p class="section-text">
                            The system employs advanced signal processing techniques to analyze accelerometer data in real-time. 
                            The detection algorithm monitors sudden changes in G-force patterns that indicate collision events.
                        </p>
                        <h4 style="color: var(--accent-purple); margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem;">Detection Parameters</h4>
                        <ul class="about-list">
                            <li><strong>Threshold Detection:</strong> G-force exceeding 5G indicates potential collision</li>
                            <li><strong>Pulse Analysis:</strong> Duration and intensity of impact force measurement</li>
                            <li><strong>Pattern Recognition:</strong> Distinguishes between normal driving and collision events</li>
                            <li><strong>False Positive Prevention:</strong> Algorithm filters out non-collision events</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- Emergency Response Protocol -->
                <section class="about-section">
                    <h3 class="section-title">Emergency Response Protocol</h3>
                    <div class="glass-panel">
                        <p class="section-text">
                            Upon collision detection, the system automatically initiates a multi-step emergency response protocol 
                            designed to minimize response time and maximize rescue effectiveness.
                        </p>
                        <h4 style="color: var(--status-critical); margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem;">Alert Sequence</h4>
                        <ul class="about-list">
                            <li><strong>Immediate Alert:</strong> SMS sent to pre-configured emergency contacts within 5 seconds</li>
                            <li><strong>Location Sharing:</strong> GPS coordinates included in alert message</li>
                            <li><strong>Web Dashboard Update:</strong> Real-time status update on monitoring system</li>
                            <li><strong>Emergency Services:</strong> Optional automatic notification to local emergency services</li>
                            <li><strong>Status Monitoring:</strong> Continuous monitoring of vehicle status post-collision</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- Web Dashboard Features -->
                <section class="about-section">
                    <h3 class="section-title">Web Dashboard Features</h3>
                    <div class="glass-panel">
                        <h4 style="color: var(--accent-blue); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Real-time Monitoring</h4>
                        <ul class="about-list">
                            <li>Live sensor data visualization and status monitoring</li>
                            <li>Interactive GPS mapping with real-time location tracking</li>
                            <li>Emergency alert management and response coordination</li>
                            <li>Historical data analysis and reporting system</li>
                            <li>Multi-user access with role-based permissions</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </section>

            </div>

        </main>

    </div>

    <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
